OL,3,A'Unprecedented' murder cases see police
OL,4,Aforce consider 'zero-hours' detectives
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn "unprecedented" number of murder
OL,7,Finvestigations this year could see
OL,8,FGwent Police hire detectives on
OL,9,F"zero-hour" style contracts to cope
OL,10,Fwith demand.
OL,12,FChief Constable Mark Hobrough said the
OL,13,Fforce would normally see two or three
OL,14,Fmurder probes a year, but has launched
OL,15,F11 in the past 10 months.
OL,17,FAs a result it has had to fund record
OL,18,Famounts of overtime payments and take
OL,19,Fneighbourhood officers away from
OL,20,Fcommunity policing duties to cope with
OL,21,Fthe demand.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
