OL,3,A'Unprecedented' murder cases see police
OL,4,Aforce consider 'zero-hours' detectives
OL,5,
OL,6,FHobrough said the 1,535 officer-strong
OL,7,Fforce would use the additional
OL,8,Fdetectives if the same trend continues
OL,9,Fnext year, but did not specify where
OL,10,Fthey would come from or how the scheme
OL,11,Fwould work.
